<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Experimental Setup and Implementation Details</h3>

<section id="A1.SS5.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.5.1 </span>Datasets and Metrics</h4>

<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our experimental evaluation is conducted on seven diverse benchmarks across two primary tasks: Table Question Answering (TQA) and Table Fact Verification (TFV). We follow the established protocol of previous works <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zheng et al., 2024</a>; <a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al., 2025</a>)</cite> for evaluation metrics, using Accuracy for most tasks and BLEU score for the generative FeTaQA benchmark. Table <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.5.1 Datasets and Metrics ‣ A.5 Experimental Setup and Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ TableDART: Dynamic Adaptive Multi-Modal Routing for Table Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> provides a detailed breakdown of these datasets, including the number of instances used for our training mixture and the full size of the official test sets.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task Type</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Train</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Validation</span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Test</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" rowspan="5"><span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Table Question</span></span>
<span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Answering (TQA)</span></span>
</span></span><span id="A1.T8.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">TABMWP</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">2,000</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">300</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">7,686</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">WTQ</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">2,000</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">300</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4,344</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">HiTab</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">—</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">—</td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1,586</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
